# Change summary

After finishing a set of code or config changes in a turn, end the reply with a roughly 25-word summary of what changed and why.

- Keep it one short paragraph (about 20–30 words).
- Cover the outcome, not a file laundry list.
- Skip the summary only when no changes were made (e.g. pure Q&A).
